{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "sipps-api-collection-v1",
    "name": "SIPPS API",
    "description": "Sistem Informasi Poin Pelanggaran Siswa (SIPPS) - Backend API Collection\n\n**Base URL:** `{{base_url}}`\n\n**Auth:** Most endpoints require a Bearer Token. Run the **Login** request first, then the collection will auto-set the token via the test script.\n\n**Roles:**\n- `Admin` – full access\n- `BK` – bimbingan konseling\n- `Wali Kelas` – limited to rombel\n- `Siswa`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔓 Auth",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints – no token required.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "  console.log('✅ Token saved:', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login dengan username dan password. Token JWT akan otomatis tersimpan di variabel `token`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"newuser\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"id_role\": 3\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            },
            "description": "Register user baru. `id_role` opsional (default: 3).\n\nRole IDs:\n- 1: Admin\n- 2: Guru / PTK\n- 3: Default\n- 101: Kepala Sekolah\n- 102: Wakasek\n- 103: Wali Kelas\n- 6: Siswa"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/profile",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil profil user yang sedang login berdasarkan token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📋 Poin Pelanggaran",
      "description": "Manajemen master data poin/kategori pelanggaran.\n\n**Auth required.** Create & Delete: Admin only. Update: Admin, BK.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Poin Pelanggaran",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/poin-pelanggaran",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["poin-pelanggaran"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil seluruh daftar poin/kategori pelanggaran, diurutkan berdasarkan `id_poin`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Poin Pelanggaran by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/poin-pelanggaran/1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["poin-pelanggaran", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil satu data poin pelanggaran berdasarkan `id_poin`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Poin Pelanggaran",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jenis_penilaian\": \"Negatif\",\n  \"jenis_pelanggaran\": \"Terlambat Masuk Kelas\",\n  \"bobot\": 5\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/poin-pelanggaran",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["poin-pelanggaran"]
            },
            "description": "Menambahkan kategori pelanggaran baru.\n\n**Role:** Admin only\n\n**Body:**\n- `jenis_penilaian` (string, required): `\"Positif\"` atau `\"Negatif\"`\n- `jenis_pelanggaran` (string, required): nama pelanggaran\n- `bobot` (number, required): nilai poin (angka)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Poin Pelanggaran",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jenis_penilaian\": \"Negatif\",\n  \"jenis_pelanggaran\": \"Terlambat Masuk Kelas\",\n  \"bobot\": 10,\n  \"is_active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/poin-pelanggaran/1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["poin-pelanggaran", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Memperbaharui data poin pelanggaran berdasarkan `id_poin`.\n\n**Role:** Admin, BK\n\n**Body:**\n- `jenis_penilaian` (string, required)\n- `jenis_pelanggaran` (string, required)\n- `bobot` (number, required)\n- `is_active` (boolean, required)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Poin Pelanggaran",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/poin-pelanggaran/1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["poin-pelanggaran", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Menghapus data poin pelanggaran berdasarkan `id`.\n\n**Role:** Admin only"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
